## Checkpoint Format

All checkpoints follow this structure for team compatibility:

\`\`\`python
checkpoint = {
    'config': {
        'mode': 'dense',       # or 'cp'
        'd_hidden': 256,
        'noise_std': 0.4,
        'weight_decay': 0.5,
        # ... flat config dict
    },
    'model_state_dict': model.state_dict(),
    'metrics': {
        'train_acc': float,
        'val_acc': float,
        'effective_rank': float,
    },
    'seed': int,
    'eigenvalues': Tensor,     # [10, 256] (n_classes, d_hidden)
    'eigenvectors': Tensor,    # [10, 256, 784] (n_classes, d_hidden, d_input)
}
# Path: results/phase1/checkpoints/{config_name}_seed{seed}.pt
