## Key Paper Claims to Verify

### Section 4 (Vision)
- **Effective rank ratio** (reg/no-reg) < 0.5
- **Accuracy**: ~94-95% with regularization
- **Top eigenvectors** visually resemble digits
- **~10 eigenvalues** per class capture digit structure

### Section 5 (Language)
- **VERIFIED** (2026-01-14): \`tdooms/ts-medium\` IS the paper's "ts-tiny" (6L, 512d, 29.4M params)
- ⚠️ **SAE LIMITATION**: ts-medium layer 4 lacks \`mlp-in\` SAEs on HuggingFace (only \`mlp-out\`, \`resid-mid\`, \`resid-pre\`)
- **Figure 8 Reproduction**: fw-medium only (requires both \`mlp-in\` and \`mlp-out\` SAEs)
  - Features **3834** (not-good), **751** (not-bad) - tutorial example
  - Paper's ts-medium features (1882/1179) not reproducible without internal SAE checkpoints
- **Figure 9 Reproduction**: All 3 models work (only needs \`mlp-out\` SAEs)
  - ts-medium (6L, layer 4, expansion=4)
  - fw-small (12L, layer 8, expansion=4)
  - fw-medium (16L, layer 7, expansion=8)
- **Opposing directions**: Cosine similarity < 0 (verified in fw-medium)

