## Common Pitfalls

1. **Don't reimplement** - wrap original code
2. **Don't modify** \`bilinear-decomposition-main/\`
3. **Use ratio-based** effective rank formula (not entropy)
4. **Handle both** \`train_acc\` and \`train/acc\` column formats
5. **Language experiments** are slow on MPS (~4-6 hours)
6. **Use pretrained SAEs** from HuggingFace when available
7. **Model name mismatch** - Paper's "ts-tiny" is \`tdooms/ts-medium\` on HuggingFace
8. **SAE expansion** - fw-small-scope only has expansion=4 available (not 8)
9. **SAE Limitation** - ts-medium layer 4 lacks mlp-in SAEs. Figure 8 must use fw-medium (tutorial features 3834/751)
